            <ui:InvokeCode ContinueOnError="{x:Null}" Code="// === Args (In/Out): DataTable dtTransactionReport, DataTable dtTransactionReportRev ===&#xA;// Pairs reversals using: ARN_BASE + Authorization Number + Transaction Type + Abs(Billing Amount)&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;// ---------- Helpers ----------&#xA;string SafeStr(object o) { return (o == null || o == DBNull.Value) ? &quot;&quot; : o.ToString().Trim(); }&#xA;&#xA;bool TryParseSignedAmount(object val, out decimal amount)&#xA;{&#xA;    amount = 0m;&#xA;    if (val == null || val == DBNull.Value) return false;&#xA;    string s = val.ToString().Trim();&#xA;    if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(s)) return false;&#xA;&#xA;    // normalize&#xA;    s = s.Replace(&quot;\u00A0&quot;,&quot;&quot;).Replace(&quot;,&quot;, &quot;&quot;);&#xA;    bool paren = s.StartsWith(&quot;(&quot;) &amp;&amp; s.EndsWith(&quot;)&quot;);&#xA;    if (paren) s = s.Substring(1, s.Length - 2);&#xA;    bool trailingMinus = s.EndsWith(&quot;-&quot;);&#xA;    if (trailingMinus) s = s.Substring(0, s.Length - 1);&#xA;&#xA;    if (!decimal.TryParse(s, NumberStyles.Number, CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, out amount))&#xA;        return false;&#xA;&#xA;    if (paren || trailingMinus) amount = -amount;&#xA;    return true;&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;int CompareByTxnDate(DataRow a, DataRow b)&#xA;{&#xA;    // Works whether the column is DateTime or string&#xA;    DateTime da, db;&#xA;    object va = a.Table.Columns.Contains(&quot;Transaction Date&quot;) ? a[&quot;Transaction Date&quot;] : null;&#xA;    object vb = b.Table.Columns.Contains(&quot;Transaction Date&quot;) ? b[&quot;Transaction Date&quot;] : null;&#xA;&#xA;    bool pa = false, pb = false;&#xA;    if (va is DateTime) { da = (DateTime)va; pa = true; }&#xA;    else { pa = DateTime.TryParse(SafeStr(va), out da); }&#xA;&#xA;    if (vb is DateTime) { db = (DateTime)vb; pb = true; }&#xA;    else { pb = DateTime.TryParse(SafeStr(vb), out db); }&#xA;&#xA;    if (pa &amp;&amp; pb) return da.CompareTo(db);&#xA;    if (pa &amp;&amp; !pb) return -1;&#xA;    if (!pa &amp;&amp; pb) return 1;&#xA;    return 0;&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;void CopyRow_Optimized(DataRow source, DataRow target, DataTable targetTable)&#xA;{&#xA;    foreach (DataColumn col in targetTable.Columns)&#xA;        if (source.Table.Columns.Contains(col.ColumnName))&#xA;            target[col.ColumnName] = source[col.ColumnName];&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;string ArnBase(string arnRaw)&#xA;{&#xA;    string arn = SafeStr(arnRaw);&#xA;    if (arn.Length == 0) return &quot;&quot;;&#xA;    int slash = arn.IndexOf('/');&#xA;    if (slash &gt;= 0) arn = arn.Substring(0, slash);&#xA;    if (arn.Length &gt; 23) arn = arn.Substring(0, 23);&#xA;    return arn;&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;// ---------- 1) Ensure MATCH columns ----------&#xA;if (!dtTransactionReport.Columns.Contains(&quot;MATCH&quot;))&#xA;    dtTransactionReport.Columns.Add(&quot;MATCH&quot;, typeof(bool));&#xA;if (!dtTransactionReportRev.Columns.Contains(&quot;MATCH&quot;))&#xA;    dtTransactionReportRev.Columns.Add(&quot;MATCH&quot;, typeof(bool));&#xA;&#xA;// ---------- 2) Collect unmatched candidates with required fields ----------&#xA;var candidates = new List&lt;DataRow&gt;();&#xA;for (int i = 0; i &lt; dtTransactionReport.Rows.Count; i++)&#xA;{&#xA;    var r = dtTransactionReport.Rows[i];&#xA;    if (!(r[&quot;MATCH&quot;] != DBNull.Value &amp;&amp; Convert.ToBoolean(r[&quot;MATCH&quot;])) &amp;&amp;&#xA;        !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(SafeStr(r[&quot;Authorization Number&quot;])) &amp;&amp;&#xA;        !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(SafeStr(r[&quot;Transaction Type&quot;])) &amp;&amp;&#xA;        !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(SafeStr(r[&quot;Billing Amount&quot;])))&#xA;    {&#xA;        candidates.Add(r);&#xA;    }&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;// ---------- 3) Build lookup by (ARN_BASE + AUTH + TXNTYPE + |Billing Amount|) ----------&#xA;var lookup = new Dictionary&lt;string, List&lt;DataRow&gt;&gt;(StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase);&#xA;for (int i = 0; i &lt; candidates.Count; i++)&#xA;{&#xA;    var row = candidates[i];&#xA;&#xA;    if (!TryParseSignedAmount(row[&quot;Billing Amount&quot;], out var amt)) continue;&#xA;&#xA;    string auth    = SafeStr(row[&quot;Authorization Number&quot;]);&#xA;    string txnType = SafeStr(row[&quot;Transaction Type&quot;]).ToUpperInvariant();&#xA;    string arnBase = ArnBase(SafeStr(row[&quot;ARN&quot;]));  // &lt;= NEW: tie to the ARN chain&#xA;&#xA;    if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(auth) || string.IsNullOrEmpty(txnType))&#xA;        continue;&#xA;&#xA;    string key = arnBase + &quot;|&quot; + auth + &quot;|&quot; + txnType + &quot;|&quot; + Math.Abs(amt).ToString(&quot;0.00&quot;, CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);&#xA;    if (!lookup.TryGetValue(key, out var list))&#xA;    {&#xA;        list = new List&lt;DataRow&gt;();&#xA;        lookup[key] = list;&#xA;    }&#xA;    list.Add(row);&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;// ---------- 4) Within each group, pair positives vs negatives (same key) ----------&#xA;int pairsMade = 0;&#xA;foreach (var kvp in lookup)&#xA;{&#xA;    var rows = kvp.Value;&#xA;&#xA;    var pos = new List&lt;DataRow&gt;();&#xA;    var neg = new List&lt;DataRow&gt;();&#xA;&#xA;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; rows.Count; i++)&#xA;    {&#xA;        var r = rows[i];&#xA;        if (TryParseSignedAmount(r[&quot;Billing Amount&quot;], out var amt))&#xA;        {&#xA;            if (amt &gt; 0) pos.Add(r);&#xA;            else if (amt &lt; 0) neg.Add(r);&#xA;        }&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    pos.Sort(CompareByTxnDate);&#xA;    neg.Sort(CompareByTxnDate);&#xA;&#xA;    int pairCount = Math.Min(pos.Count, neg.Count);&#xA;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; pairCount; i++)&#xA;    {&#xA;        pos[i][&quot;MATCH&quot;] = true;&#xA;        neg[i][&quot;MATCH&quot;] = true;&#xA;        pairsMade++;&#xA;    }&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;// ---------- 5) Move matched rows to dtTransactionReportRev ----------&#xA;var toMove = new List&lt;DataRow&gt;();&#xA;for (int i = 0; i &lt; dtTransactionReport.Rows.Count; i++)&#xA;{&#xA;    var r = dtTransactionReport.Rows[i];&#xA;    if (r[&quot;MATCH&quot;] != DBNull.Value &amp;&amp; Convert.ToBoolean(r[&quot;MATCH&quot;]))&#xA;        toMove.Add(r);&#xA;}&#xA;for (int i = 0; i &lt; toMove.Count; i++)&#xA;{&#xA;    var row = toMove[i];&#xA;    var newRow = dtTransactionReportRev.NewRow();&#xA;    CopyRow_Optimized(row, newRow, dtTransactionReportRev);&#xA;    newRow[&quot;MATCH&quot;] = true;&#xA;    dtTransactionReportRev.Rows.Add(newRow);&#xA;}&#xA;for (int i = 0; i &lt; toMove.Count; i++)&#xA;    dtTransactionReport.Rows.Remove(toMove[i]);&#xA;&#xA;// ---------- 6) Finalize ----------&#xA;dtTransactionReport.AcceptChanges();&#xA;dtTransactionReportRev.AcceptChanges();&#xA;&#xA;// ---------- 7) Summary ----------&#xA;int matchedRows = 0;&#xA;for (int i = 0; i &lt; dtTransactionReportRev.Rows.Count; i++)&#xA;    if (dtTransactionReportRev.Rows[i][&quot;MATCH&quot;] != DBNull.Value &amp;&amp; Convert.ToBoolean(dtTransactionReportRev.Rows[i][&quot;MATCH&quot;]))&#xA;        matchedRows++;&#xA;&#xA;Console.WriteLine(&quot;=============================================&quot;);&#xA;Console.WriteLine($&quot;✅ Matched reversal pairs (ARN_BASE+Auth+TxnType+|Amt|): {pairsMade}&quot;);&#xA;Console.WriteLine($&quot;✅ Rows moved to dtTransactionReportRev: {matchedRows}&quot;);&#xA;Console.WriteLine($&quot;✅ Remaining rows in dtTransactionReport: {dtTransactionReport.Rows.Count}&quot;);&#xA;Console.WriteLine(&quot;=============================================&quot;);&#xA;" DisplayName="Remove Auto REV GRP (DR/CR PAIR)" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="477.3333333333333,197.33333333333334" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="InvokeCode_31" Language="CSharp">
